    <rdfs:label>bic</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Business Identifier Code (BIC), also known as SWIFT-BIC or SWIFT code, is a unique 8 or 11-character alphanumeric code standardized by [ISO 9362](https://www.iso.org/standard/84108.html) to identify financial and non-financial institutions (e.g., `BBWCUS33`).</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/dataCollectionProcess">
